# For the IDE only (VSRocq reads it): which logical names map to which
# compiled files. It does not build anything, and lists no files: the
# project is built by dune alone (`dune build`), and these are dune's
# outputs, so build before stepping through a file. Until 2026-11-05 this
# was _CoqProject, which also drove a second build through make.
-R _build/default/theories MEBI
-R _build/default/test/rocq MEBITests
-R _build/default/examples MEBI.Examples
-I _build/install/default/lib
